# Format, one entry per line:
#   <name>                     fetched from upstream basecamp/omarchy (themes/<name>)
#   <name> basecamp            same as above, explicit
#   <name> <git-url>           cloned from a specific git URL (kept as a clone)
#
# Lines starting with # are comments.

